        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Solid Aluminum Push Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Solid Aluminum Store Door Push Bar is custom made to order to fit your specific needs. It is available in lengths up to 36 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 147 Push Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum </li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection 2-1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Clearance 1-1/2”</li>\r\n<li>ANSI J501</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade to order. <b>NOT Returnable.</b> \r\n</p>",
